   "text": "You may have been told to watch this video about the OpenAI AI hack. You really should, even if you don't usually care about any tech stuff.\n\nIf nothing else, click this link to the 18 minutes in & see how the agents spoke & coordinated with each other. Its eye opening.  youtu.be/87DyyMV0kCY?...",
