  {
   "text": "Here’s why AI chatbots (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini etc) are unreliable for science content, and terrible as “just a starting point” for science communicators. \n\nUnfortunately, this probably isn’t something AI chatbots get much better at… although sloppers will get better at hiding it!",
